WEBVTT

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.400
We did it! Come on, girls,
let's go!

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.960
But what about the other people
who ordered cookies?

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:30.640
Life is full of disappointments

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.400
for some people.

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.360
Don't do that!

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:42.320
Super Silly Fun Land! Can we go?
Please?

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:43.760
No.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:46.240
But we've never been. And it's
the funnest place on earth!

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:47.320
Don't care.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.480
- Please?
- Please?

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.120
We'll never ask for anything else,
ever again!

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.160
- Pretty please?
- Please?

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:00.880
- Come on!
- Come on!

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.640
Light bulb.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:09.880
Come on!

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.840
Goodbye, have fun.

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:19.520
Sorry, dude.
They can't ride without an adult.

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:20.960
What?

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.480
Oh, my gosh!

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:18.880
Look at that fluffy unicorn!

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:23.720
He's so fluffy, I'm gonna die!

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.200
You've gotta let us play for it!

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:26.880
No, no, no.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.240
Come on!

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:32.160
How much for the fluffy unicorn?

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:35.160
Well, it is not for sale.

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:37.120
But all you gotta do to win it

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:39.560
is knock down
that little spaceship there.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:41.880
It's easy!

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:51.200
Yay!

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:03.840
Again!

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:06.880
- Wait!
- Come on. One more time!

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:08.080
Just one more.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.400
I accidentally closed my eyes.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.040
- I hit it! I hit it!
- That was cool.

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:34.080
Whoa, whoa, whoa. What was that?

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:37.760
She hit that. I saw that
with my own eyes.

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:40.480
Hey, buddy,
let me explain something to you.

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:44.880
You see that little tin spaceship?
You see how it's not knocked over?

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.720
Do you know what that means,
professor?

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:51.200
It means you don't get the unicorn!

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.040
Somebody's got a frowny face.

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:57.440
Boo! Better luck next time!

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:02.160
Okay, my turn.

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:25.120
Knocked over!

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:32.080
- It's so fluffy!
- Yeah!

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:34.720
That was awesome!

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.360
You blew up the whole thing!

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:38.720
Let's go. Let's try another game!

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:47.800
Gru, do you mind if I have
a quick word?

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.680
Okay, girls, go play.

00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:00.120
I got the shrink ray!

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:04.760
Cotton candy!

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:09.520
We have 12 days until the moon
is in optimum position.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.640
We can't afford any distractions!

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:14.520
Get me Perkins.

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:24.280
Sorry to bother you, Mr Perkins,

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:28.160
but I figured that you would want
to see this!

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:30.000
What?

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.400
Well done, Gru. Rather impressive.

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:47.360
Now, the rest
of the plan is simple.

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:51.560
I fly to the moon.
I shrink the moon.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:55.200
I grab the moon.
I sit on the toilet.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:56.840
What?

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:58.960
Sorry. Sorry!

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:02.040
Could you excuse me
for just one second?

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:03.480
I told you not to touch my things.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:06.440
I told you, I told you.
I've told you a thousand times.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:08.160
Hey, can we order pizza?

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:10.080
Pizza? You just had lunch.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:11.280
Not now, for dinner.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:12.840
Dinner?

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:15.640
Just... Fine, fine, fine, whatever.
Just get back in there!

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:17.440
Can we get stuffed crust?

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:19.840
- Stuffed crust!
- Stuffed crust!

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:21.440
I'll stuff you all in the crust!

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:24.680
You're funny!

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:27.400
Just don't come out
of that room again!

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:28.880
All right.

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:33.080
Sorry about that. Where were we?

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.680
You were sitting on the toilet.

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:39.120
No, no, no! No, I'm sorry.
It was a little attempt at humour.

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:41.880
I know how much you like to laugh

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:47.880
inside. Now, I was saying...

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:53.240
You don't seem terribly focused,
Gru.

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:55.600
Believe me,
I am completely focused.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.600
- Hello!
- What?

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:58.800
That guy is huge!

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.240
- Are we on TV?
- What are those? Children?

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:03.000
What are you doing?
I told you to stay out of here!

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.200
No, no, no!

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:10.280
Freeze ray!

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.880
Mr Gru?

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:17.720
Okay.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.360
As I was saying...

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:24.120
No need to continue.
I've seen quite enough.

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:26.480
- But my plan...
- Is a great plan.

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:29.600
I love everything about your plan,
except for one thing.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:31.720
You.

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:38.280
Look, Mom, I drew a picture of me
landing on the moon!

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:45.120
Look, Mom, I made a prototype of
the rocket out of macaroni!

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:51.840
Look, Mom, I made a real rocket
based on the macaroni prototype!

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:04.320
I don't understand.

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:06.840
Let's face reality, Gru.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:11.480
You've been at this for far too
long with far too little success.

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:15.720
We're gonna put our faith,
our money, into a...

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:18.080
Well, a younger villain.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.600
But I...

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:21.680
It's over. Goodbye, Gru.

